Update Qt 6.12.0 bundled libpng from 1.6.58 to 1.6.59.

Modified by Mervin PDF on 2026-11-04.
Preserve Qt build rules, feature configuration and symbol prefixing.
Source https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/compare/v1.6.58...v1.6.59
Includes CVE-2026-46675 and the allocation-failure double-free fix.

diff --git a/src/3rdparty/libpng/ANNOUNCE b/src/3rdparty/libpng/ANNOUNCE
--- a/src/3rdparty/libpng/ANNOUNCE
+++ b/src/3rdparty/libpng/ANNOUNCE
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
-libpng 1.6.58 - April 15, 2026
-==============================
+libpng 1.6.59 - September 28, 2026
+==================================
 
 This is a public release of libpng, intended for use in production code.
 
@@ -9,10 +9,10 @@
 
